    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Zeina Dimassi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105709726504591296409/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU8CzJ_fbCQbqHdbnglFbf0ZGLwC8Ny_5gXPyy5tiaAhyqyzCMQ8Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I can’t recommend Maria's service highly enough. From the moment I walked in, I felt genuinely cared for and understood. She takes the time to listen, explain everything clearly, and tailor the treatment to exactly what your body needs. Her professionalism, skill, and gentle approach made an immediate difference in my pain and overall well-being.\n\nWhat truly sets her apart is the compassion and dedication she shows in every session—she clearly love what she does, and it shows in the results. I’m deeply grateful for the relief she's brought me over the years and for the exceptional quality of care I’ve received.\n\nIf you’re looking for an osteopath who is knowledgeable, attentive, and truly invested in your health, look no further. Absolutely outstanding service.",
        "time": 1765298567,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "b brad",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117812878999870154406/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJo5cezJ_XS1VocmT-THUDlo6rR6uaKpdAdSozdlq4WGnbnNo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Just getting into my car after my appointment,  assured that Maria-Rosario worked some small miracle on my back!\nI wouldn’t hesitate to return.",
        "time": 1763034176,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "dean/mercedes Leduc",
