        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJkSt9O7bGBoSCnvYu8IL2lX6EECF0Z1wc_cCuRjXthT02YQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I recently visited this clinic. I was very impressed with service rendered and the warm welcome. The room was relaxing and inviting, and the service professional, courteous and attentive.\nI strongly recommend this clinic and the services of Ms Maria.\nI feel better already. Thank you for taking such good care of me.",
        "time": 1684102246,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
